<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 25.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MARCH 25.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, March 25 on Monday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   25.03.97	  24.03.97     </p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4196	 6.3702</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3648	 2.3639</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5894	 4.5850</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2577	 3.2395	 </p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5239	 0.5229</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7919	 0.7908</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2956	 0.2955</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8794	 6.8746</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7006	 0.7000</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2968	 1.2963</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
